{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 96,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.4332885742188,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "14 years. However, the cost of the regimen (driven by the price of delamanid) remains a barrier to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        173.24420166015625,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "widespread adoption.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.40792846679688,
        209.15652465820312,
        124.25992584228516
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.4678497314453,
        527.4497680664062,
        145.9108428955078
      ],
      "text": "Based on research evidence and expert experience, the panel identified subpopulations of people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        144.6678009033203,
        527.4530029296875,
        159.1107940673828
      ],
      "text": "who might be affected differently than most by this recommendation; these subpopulations were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.86793518066406,
        527.424560546875,
        172.31092834472656
      ],
      "text": "PLHIV, children, pregnant and breastfeeding women, patients with extrapulmonary TB and patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.0679473876953,
        527.4156494140625,
        185.5109405517578
      ],
      "text": "with extensive TB disease and resistance to fluoroquinolones. The recent new recommendation for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        182.99183654785156,
        527.4158935546875,
        198.71083068847656
      ],
      "text": "(30) the use of bedaquiline in children with MDR/RR-TB aged below 6 years was considered  . The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        197.4678497314453,
        397.426513671875,
        211.9108428955078
      ],
      "text": "panel noted specific considerations for the subpopulations listed below.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        228.3115997314453,
        207.4549102783203,
        243.97158813476562
      ],
      "text": "Children and adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.1796417236328,
        527.5267333984375,
        265.6226501464844
      ],
      "text": "Thirty participants aged 8–17 years with confirmed RR-TB were enrolled in the study, with 17 in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        264.37957763671875,
        527.4321899414062,
        278.8226013183594
      ],
      "text": "the control group and 13 in the intervention group. Among them, seven (24%) had FQ resistance.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        277.57958984375,
        527.2250366210938,
        292.0226135253906
      ],
      "text": "One participant aged 17 years was found to have resistance to bedaquiline and clofazimine at",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        290.77960205078125,
        527.443115234375,
        305.2226257324219
      ],
      "text": "baseline and was switched to an individualized rescue regimen. There were three Grade 3 or 4 AEs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.9796142578125,
        527.2778930664062,
        318.4226379394531
      ],
      "text": "related to linezolid (1 case each of anemia, peripheral neuropathy and optic neuritis). Delamanid was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9941987991333,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        317.17962646484375,
        479.86822509765625,
        331.6226501464844
      ],
      "text": "discontinued in one participant on the control arm owing to neuropsychiatric side effects.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        338.8835144042969,
        527.3861083984375,
        353.3265380859375
      ],
      "text": "In addition to the trial data, all medicines in the BDLLfxC regimen have been used in children and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        352.08349609375,
        527.4343872070312,
        366.5265197753906
      ],
      "text": "adolescents, have well-documented safety and efficacy profiles, and have sufficient pharmacokinetic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        365.28350830078125,
        527.4442749023438,
        379.7265319824219
      ],
      "text": "and pharmacodynamic data. Thus, the recommendation of the BDLLfxC regimen applies to adults,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        378.4835205078125,
        238.2201385498047,
        392.9265441894531
      ],
      "text": "adolescents and children of any age.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.327392578125,
        190.875732421875,
        424.9873962402344
      ],
      "text": "People living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.1953125,
        527.4367065429688,
        446.6383361816406
      ],
      "text": "All participants of the BEAT-TB trial were required to undergo an HIV test, but the test result and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        445.3952941894531,
        527.4575805664062,
        459.83831787109375
      ],
      "text": "their CD4+ count, or whether they were receiving ART at the time of randomization, did not affect",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        458.5953063964844,
        527.4147338867188,
        473.038330078125
      ],
      "text": "their eligibility for the trial. The management of HIV infection followed the guidelines of the National",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.7953186035156,
        527.4267578125,
        486.23834228515625
      ],
      "text": "Department of Health of South Africa. ART included either dolutegravir or a protease inhibitor to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.9953918457031,
        527.6285400390625,
        499.43841552734375
      ],
      "text": "prevent drug–drug interactions, and non-nucleoside reverse transcriptase inhibitors were prohibited.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990946769714355,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        498.1953125,
        527.5015869140625,
        512.6383056640625
      ],
      "text": "In BEAT-TB, 202 PLHIV were enrolled, with 105 randomized to the study arm. The median CD4+ in this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.964693069458008,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        511.395263671875,
        527.4323120117188,
        525.8382568359375
      ],
      "text": "group was 168 (95% CI: 85.0, 299). No major effect of HIV status on the efficacy of the intervention",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        524.5953369140625,
        527.4659423828125,
        539.038330078125
      ],
      "text": "regimen vs the control was observed (risk difference 2.1% (95% CI: –7.9%, +12.2%). Thus, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        537.7952880859375,
        527.4046020507812,
        552.23828125
      ],
      "text": "recommendation for the BDLLfxC regimen applies to all people, regardless of HIV status or degree",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        550.995361328125,
        383.5862121582031,
        565.4383544921875
      ],
      "text": "of immunosuppression and appeared preferable to the comparator.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        581.8391723632812,
        269.50933837890625,
        597.4992065429688
      ],
      "text": "Pregnant and breastfeeding women",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        604.7070922851562,
        527.4201049804688,
        619.1500854492188
      ],
      "text": "The components of BDLLfxC have been used in pregnancy in women with MDR/RR-TB. Pregnant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        617.9072265625,
        527.2130126953125,
        632.3502197265625
      ],
      "text": "women could be enrolled in the BEAT-TB trial in any trimester of pregnancy. Also, women who become",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.955158233642578,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        631.107177734375,
        527.3861694335938,
        645.5501708984375
      ],
      "text": "pregnant during the trial could continue their treatment without any changes. Of the 10 pregnant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        644.3071899414062,
        527.44775390625,
        658.7501831054688
      ],
      "text": "women (4 to the trial regimen) enrolled, all pregnancies resulted in singleton live births, with one",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        657.507080078125,
        527.4024658203125,
        671.9500732421875
      ],
      "text": "premature delivery. One woman in the study strategy experienced a relapse. There were two severe",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        670.7070922851562,
        292.30487060546875,
        685.1500854492188
      ],
      "text": "AEs in this group, but neither were drug-related.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        692.4111328125,
        527.6177368164062,
        706.8541259765625
      ],
      "text": "Based on existing experience using the BDLLfxC regimen’s component drugs, the trial data and other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992047309875488,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.611083984375,
        527.4344482421875,
        720.0540771484375
      ],
      "text": "currently recommended alternatives, the BDLLfxC regimen is recommended for use in pregnant and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        718.8110961914062,
        173.12319946289062,
        733.2540893554688
      ],
      "text": "breastfeeding women.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "82 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}